flowchart TB
  N["Native Rust caller"] -->|"typed rule call"| O["Invocation owner in rules crate<br/>limits, scheduling, report and cleanup"]
  P["Skill tool or optional TS caller"] -->|"versioned request"| C["Executable boundary<br/>framing and serialization"]
  C --> O
  O --> R["Rule admission owner<br/>JSONL, question and policy checks"]
  O --> E["Evidence crate<br/>capture, diff, target and search"]
  R --> F["Selection owner<br/>applicability and declared dependencies"]
  E --> F
  F --> J["Judgment owner in decisions crate<br/>request correlation and outcomes"]
  J --> B["Jev adapter<br/>HTTP attempts, credentials and body admission"]
  B <-->|"native JSON / response"| X["OpenRouter System One"]
  J --> V["Policy owner<br/>interpret Sunstack-authored bands or labels"]
  V --> O
  J -.-> A["Future backend adapter<br/>not implemented in v1"]
